      acceptedAnswer: {
        '@type': 'Answer',
        text: 'Red to the dead battery positive, red to the donor positive, black to the donor negative, then the final black to an unpainted engine ground on the dead car — not to the battery. Connecting the last clamp away from the battery keeps sparks away from the hydrogen a charging battery can emit.',
